sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Developer client
    participant E as Edge
    participant A as Auth
    participant L as Limiter
    participant S as API service
    participant I as Inference
    participant M as Metering
    C->>E: POST /v1/messages + bearer key + version header
    E->>A: resolve hashed key from a leased local cache
    A-->>E: org, workspace, scopes, tier
    E->>L: check key, workspace, org and global budgets
    Note over E,L: reserve prompt + max_tokens — the upper bound
    alt over limit
        E-->>C: 429 with Retry-After and which limit was hit
    else admitted
        E->>S: forward with resolved identity
        S->>S: validate against the requested version, then idempotency key
        S->>I: submit
        I-->>S: token stream
        S-->>C: SSE events under a versioned schema, then usage + stop reason
        I->>M: usage counted at the source (async)
        M->>L: refresh live counters
        M->>M: durable idempotent ledger for billing
    end
